        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Operation Clarion, Battle of Fort Driant, Battle of Metz\n- Topics: World War II campaigns\n\nFacts:\n- The Battle of Fort Driant was a constituent battle in the 1944 Battle of Metz.\n- Operation Clarion attacked 200 German communication network targets to open a campaign.\n- The campaign opened by Operation Clarion occurred later than the campaign that included the Battle of Fort Driant in the 1944 Battle of Metz.",
